.* QUIDSPPTF: DSPPTF, the fixes applied to a product.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=RLSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 25'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ACTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ACTCL2 BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=GRPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 15'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=PRODID CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=IPLSRC CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='##MACH#A'.
:VAR NAME=RELEASE CLASS=RLSCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PTFID CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PTFSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=PTFACT CLASS=ACTCL2.
:VAR NAME=PTFOPT CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PTFRLS CLASS=RLSCL.
:VAR NAME=DELAYED CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LICPTF CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SAVF CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SUPERSEDE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PREREQ CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=COREQ CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPNAME CLASS=GRPCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPLVL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=GRPSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=GRPTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=PTFS VARS='OPT PTFID PTFSTS PTFACT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=GRPS VARS='GRPNAME GRPLVL GRPSTS GRPTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display alternate view
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPPTF KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPPTFH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display PTF Status
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATAI VAR=PRODID USAGE=OUTPUT.Product ID
:DATAI VAR=IPLSRC USAGE=OUTPUT.IPL source
:DATAI VAR=RELEASE USAGE=OUTPUT.Release of base option
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PTFS SCROLL=YES.(No PTFs have been applied to this release.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105'.5=Display PTF details
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=PTFID USAGE=OUTPUT.PTF ID
:LISTCOL VAR=PTFSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=PTFACT USAGE=OUTPUT.IPL Action
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPPTFD KEYL=DKEYS HELP=DSPPTFDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display PTF Details
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PTFID USAGE=OUTPUT.PTF identifier
:DATAI VAR=PRODID USAGE=OUTPUT.Product ID
:DATAI VAR=PTFOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Option
:DATAI VAR=PTFRLS USAGE=OUTPUT.Release
:DATAI VAR=PTFSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=PTFACT USAGE=OUTPUT.IPL action
:DATAI VAR=DELAYED USAGE=OUTPUT.Delayed until the next IPL
:DATAI VAR=LICPTF USAGE=OUTPUT.Licensed Internal Code fix
:DATAI VAR=SAVF USAGE=OUTPUT.Save file
:DATAI VAR=SUPERSEDE USAGE=OUTPUT.Superseded by
:DATAI VAR=PREREQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Prerequisite PTFs
:DATAI VAR=COREQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Co-requisite PTFs
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPTFGRP KEYL=KEYS HELP=WRKPTFGRPH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with PTF Groups
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=GRPS SCROLL=YES.(No PTF groups)
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.PTF Group
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Level
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=GRPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPPTFDH.Display PTF Details - Help
:P.What the PTF database holds for one fix: where it came from, whether
it is applied, what the next IPL does to it and the fixes it needs.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKPTFGRPH.Work with PTF Groups - Help
:P.The PTF groups on the system, the level of each and whether every
fix of the group is applied.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPTFH.Display PTF Status - Help
:P.The program temporary fixes of the product and whether each is
applied, with what the next IPL does to it. Option 5 shows what the
PTF database holds for one of them.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave, F17 and F18 go to the top and the bottom.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
